# Every entry verified against the 26.1.2 merged jar with javap.
# transitive-* so port-fabric-storage (which extends StorageScreenBase / StorageContainerMenuBase) inherits access.
# AT -> AW mapping: public/protected -> accessible; *-f -> + mutable; overridden private methods -> + extendable.
#
# Dropped vs. NeoForge AT (do not exist in 26.1.2 vanilla or are NeoForge-only):
#   GuiGraphics#renderTooltipInternal   -> GuiGraphicsExtractor#tooltip(...) is already public
#   AbstractContainerScreen#renderSlotHighlightBack/Front -> unused (StorageScreenBase has its own private overloads)
#   AbstractContainerScreen#lastClickTime / lastClickButton -> removed from vanilla
#   AbstractCookingRecipe#result         -> field now lives on SingleItemRecipe
#   net/neoforged/.../StackCopySlot      -> NeoForge-only class

